        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-12-01T17:06:48.332Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Pretty much, yes. I wish the game was a bit more clear about that, the way that it is in some of the other sections, but Scene Difficulty is a lot like Environment or Villain construction - it’s a useful set of rough guidelines, but not very good as hard and fast rules. Unfortunately, much more so than those other sections the language in the scene difficulty section leans towards “do these simple things and it will work.”</p>\n<p>The creators have been more clear when they’re talking about it online or in person, I think, and the advice to read through or run some of the existing adventures to see how the system interconnects is very good; if you just jump right into building your own stuff, there are likely to be some missteps along the way.</p>",
